Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.17,0:06:28.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.65,0:00:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,不得不说 你可真有种啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to say I was impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.55,0:00:31.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你竟敢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had taken a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.93,0:00:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我对着干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting your hands dirty.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.56,0:00:42.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道吗 那些行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we were gonna have those biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.11,0:00:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,本来是给米琼恩留的\N{\fnArial\fs30}for our little Michonne and…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.33,0:00:50.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些行尸 你是给所有活人留的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were gonna use them on whoever showed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.02,0:00:51.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.81,0:00:56.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你却放火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we didn't have them,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.39,0:00:59.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,把它们全烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you burned them up,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.61,0:01:02.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,害死了我八名手下\N{\fnArial\fs30}eight of my men died.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.97,0:01:13.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,死的人你都认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you knew those men. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们保你安全 供你吃穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They kept you safe, kept you fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.10,0:01:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要我睁一只眼闭一只眼就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}As long as I looked the other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.75,0:01:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不想再像以前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it can't be like that anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.20,0:01:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该有点长进了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for you to graduate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.69,0:01:44.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你末世的生存秘诀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna tell you the secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.87,0:01:49.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人威胁你的安全 就干掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a threat, you end it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.44,0:01:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用有愧疚感 尽情享受杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't feel ashamed about enjoying it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.50,0:01:57.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能闻到弹药味 看到血液\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell the gunpowder and you see the blood…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.84,0:01:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道这说明什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know what that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.42,0:02:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}It means you're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.55,0:02:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明你是赢家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.06,0:02:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你给我牢牢记住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take the heads so that you don't ever forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.15,0:02:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么杀死别人 要么你自己死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You kill or you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.30,0:02:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你女儿的在天之灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would your daughter think.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.72,0:02:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,会怎么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}about what you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.28,0:02:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会畏惧我\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'd be afraid of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.78,0:02:36.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我一开始就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I had been like this from the start,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,说不定她现在还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}she'd be alive today.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.92,0:02:52.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把安德里亚杀了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you kill Andrea?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.03,0:02:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.77,0:02:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,看吧 她还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? She's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.01,0:03:03.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,留着她还有用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need her for something.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.20,0:03:05.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我听见你在旁边屋说的话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I heard you in the other room.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.08,0:03:07.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不需要再牺牲自己的人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to lose any more of your men.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.35,0:03:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你停手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stop this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.18,0:03:13.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你监狱里的那些朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends at the prison…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.54,0:03:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把他们都杀光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna kill them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.41,0:03:18.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都会帮我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}People are gonna help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.40,0:03:22.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我稍微夸大了点事实 就一点点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to stretch the truth a little bit, but just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.99,0:03:26.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在大家都怒火冲天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they're foaming at the mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.49,0:03:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把那些工具拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, get those tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.62,0:03:32.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna need them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.27,0:03:34.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.19,0:03:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,仔细点 把那个捡起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful. Pick that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.08,0:03:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 别磨蹭了 快拿过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Step to. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.40,0:04:03.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.99,0:04:07.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.18,0:04:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put 'em down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:21.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在去把她杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna kill her now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:26.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,以实际行动告诉我你有长进了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna show me that you've learned something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.40,0:04:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.37,0:04:35.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不下手的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}there is no way you are leaving this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.79,0:04:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就别想离开这间屋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}without doing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.67,0:04:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让我为难 你就\N{\fnArial\fs30}So don't make it hard. Just…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.85,0:04:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了她就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}just do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.72,0:04:49.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.20,0:05:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你做 你不做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you you were gonna do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.82,0:05:24.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你就是死路一条\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're gonna die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.25,0:05:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,死后你会变成行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.58,0:05:33.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会生生地撕下她的肉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna tear the flesh from her bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.97,0:05:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}In this life now,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.19,0:05:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么杀死别人 要么你自己死\N{\fnArial\fs30}you kill or you die.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:51.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,或者你死了 再咬死别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you die and you kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.85,0:07:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.58,0:08:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,从来没见过他这么生气\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen him this mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.83,0:08:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛莉去世时他也没这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even with Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.76,0:08:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全把自己封闭起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He just shut down.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.18,0:08:18.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们很容易忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.05,0:08:21.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还是个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's easy to forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.76,0:08:45.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,莫尔这辈子也没做这样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Merle never did nothing like that his whole life.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.23,0:08:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,他给了我们一个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}He gave us a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.67,0:09:09.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.52,0:09:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督提出的关于我的交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deal the Governor offered about me…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.33,0:09:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你当时必须得考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}you had to think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.98,0:09:22.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你必须考虑 我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to. I get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.32,0:09:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 我差一点就同意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I came real close.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.41,0:09:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.03,0:09:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从未谢过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never thanked you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.15,0:09:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.03,0:09:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我从大门外救回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}For getting me out there that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.66,0:09:49.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,收留我\N{\fnArial\fs30}taking me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.82,0:09:54.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你没有婴儿奶粉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if you didn't have that baby formula,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.57,0:09:57.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不会救你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.65,0:10:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本可以只拿走奶粉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have just taken the formula.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.65,0:10:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可能就是因为别的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}must have been something else, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是卡尔的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it was Carl who made the call.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.78,0:10:13.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说你属于这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said you belonged here.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.60,0:10:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是我们的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're one of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.44,0:10:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,要记住 他们在那里杀了我们八个同胞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember, they killed eight men back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里杀了五个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five here last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.53,0:10:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们与丧尸无异\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're no different from the biters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.04,0:10:36.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不把我们全部杀掉是不会收手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not gonna stop until they kill us all,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.65,0:10:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,夺走我们的辛勤成果\N{\fnArial\fs30}taken everything we've worked so hard for.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.76,0:10:42.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要彻底做个了结\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna end this once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督\N{\fnArial\fs30}Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这话很难说出口\N{\fnArial\fs30}This ain't easy to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.46,0:10:50.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不参加这次行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna have to count us out.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.06,0:10:52.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是我们的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't our fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.75,0:10:54.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只和行尸作战\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll fight against the biters,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.68,0:10:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是无辜的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}not other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.08,0:10:59.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们留在这 保护孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we'll stay here and defend the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.31,0:11:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们回来后 如果想让我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you return, if you want us gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.51,0:11:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会有怨言\N{\fnArial\fs30}no hard feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.76,0:11:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's roll!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.95,0:12:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.34,0:13:13.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,走 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, go! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.14,0:13:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on, come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.72,0:15:20.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（行善者复活得生 作恶者复活定罪）
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.02,0:15:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我个手电\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me a flashlight.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.58,0:15:43.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们分头行动 你带一队去那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's split up. You take a group that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.78,0:15:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带一队 跟着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, bring a group, follow me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.96,0:16:01.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.75,0:16:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.33,0:16:12.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我捡工具的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}When the tools dropped,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.23,0:16:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,把几把钳子留在你身后的地上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I left some pliers on the floor behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.35,0:16:22.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you can drag…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.70,0:16:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能把右脚伸过去 就能拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you can drag your right foot back, you… you can get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.41,0:16:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That… that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.82,0:16:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God. - Almost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.90,0:16:49.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会救咱俩出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get us both out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.24,0:16:51.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.55,0:16:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把锁铐打开之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now when… when you get free,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.70,0:16:58.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就去找些锋利的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}you are going to find something very sharp…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.75,0:17:02.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,插进我的脑袋\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you are going to stab me in the head.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.34,0:17:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是你要做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is what you are going to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.68,0:17:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,加油\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep trying-
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.53,0:17:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,快过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.45,0:17:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.33,0:17:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.57,0:18:04.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.51,0:18:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在南墙那边干掉几个行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We took out a few biters on the south wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.05,0:18:25.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,除此以外 很平静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other than that, everything's quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.31,0:18:27.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,下一班我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll get the next one.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.87,0:18:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得当他们回来之后会发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think happens when they return?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.89,0:18:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得悄悄溜出去 安德莉亚就成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might have to slip out. Andrea made it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.82,0:18:38.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果跑去监狱 还不如不跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}If she's at the prison, it didn't do her any good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.96,0:18:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去去就回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:43.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 轮到我了 - 呆着别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's my turn. - Stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.71,0:18:44.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.08,0:18:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿到了 拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.95,0:18:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.29,0:19:28.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,米尔顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Milton.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.95,0:19:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你还一直留在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you stay…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.50,0:19:36.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明明已经知道你的朋友在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}after you found out your friends were out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.84,0:19:41.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想放弃任何人的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to save everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.98,0:19:46.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至是总督的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the Governor for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.73,0:19:51.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有机会杀掉他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had a chance to kill him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.26,0:19:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么你最终没有动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}What stopped you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.25,0:19:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 我当时还很犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, this was before.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.79,0:19:59.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在睡觉 我有一把刀子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was asleep. I had a knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.77,0:20:03.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我还是试着用其他方法阻止事情的发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I tried to stop it all another way…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.49,0:20:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我不希望任何一个人死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I didn't want anyone to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.33,0:20:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.59,0:20:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.47,0:20:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.22,0:20:36.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.71,0:20:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得快一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.79,0:20:48.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.82,0:20:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.65,0:21:13.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.58,0:21:17.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.13,0:21:19.07,Note,0,0,0,0,,（快跑）
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.69,0:21:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get the hell out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.70,0:21:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.60,0:21:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.17,0:21:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走 - 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Move! - Go. Go, go, go. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.88,0:22:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,前进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move! Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.09,0:22:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,开火 开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hit it, hit it, hit it!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.62,0:22:12.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not working.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.64,0:22:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.75,0:22:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 卡壳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit. It's jammed!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.97,0:22:20.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Return…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.49,0:22:21.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没胜算 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not going anywhere. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.04,0:22:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.59,0:22:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.32,0:22:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.03,0:22:55.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, whoa, whoa. Don't shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.32,0:22:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,放下武器 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drop the weapon, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.58,0:22:58.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.76,0:23:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.15,0:23:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们成功了 赶走了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did it. We drove them out.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.05,0:23:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该乘胜追击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go after them.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.52,0:23:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们应该结束战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should finish it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.89,0:23:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is finished.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.65,0:23:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没看见他们逃跑了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you see them hightail it out of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.99,0:23:34.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会再来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could regroup.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.93,0:23:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't take the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.67,0:23:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督不会停止的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not gonna stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.63,0:23:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.45,0:23:38.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不能活在恐惧中\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't keep living like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.53,0:23:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要攻击伍德伯里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we take the fight back to Woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.87,0:23:41.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次我们差点都没回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We barely made it back last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.31,0:23:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}He don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.06,0:23:44.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.48,0:23:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们查查其他人 - 走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's check on the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.18,0:24:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 - 爸爸 我要去伍德伯里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Dad, I'm coming to Woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.30,0:24:17.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔 - 爸爸 我刚完成了自己的任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carl. - Dad, I did do my job out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.15,0:24:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like all of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.80,0:24:21.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我杀死了一个总督的小兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took out one of the Governor's soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.85,0:24:23.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督的小兵\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of his soldiers?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.11,0:24:26.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,他只是个逃命的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}A kid running away?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.05,0:24:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不巧遇见了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He stumbled across us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.02,0:24:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 他是要耍花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he drew on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.05,0:24:31.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 让你面对这种事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry you had to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.07,0:24:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是尽了本份而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what I was there for.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.15,0:24:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.16,0:24:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个孩子被吓坏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That kid was scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.93,0:24:45.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他正打算缴枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was handing his gun over.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.78,0:24:49.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔说他是要耍花招\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he drew.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.71,0:24:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔说他只是在自卫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl said it was in defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.75,0:24:57.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我亲眼目睹 他不必开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was there. He didn't have to shoot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.23,0:24:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全没有理由开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had every reason not to…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.60,0:24:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你只是被表面迷惑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it looked like that to you, Hershel…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.67,0:25:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.47,0:25:06.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再说一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.77,0:25:09.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他打死了那孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}he gunned that kid down.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.33,0:25:21.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,靠边停车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move over!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.84,0:25:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,把卡车给我停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! I want this truck over.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.75,0:25:25.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Pull in front of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.54,0:25:35.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们他妈的到底在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.80,0:25:36.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要赶尽杀绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to dig in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:36.71,0:25:37.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,不值得冒这个险\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.62,0:25:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是大屠杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was a slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.71,0:25:39.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们这些没种的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bunch of pussies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.99,0:25:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我早说过应该咱几个自己动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you we should have handled this shit ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.33,0:25:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想再争这破监狱了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're done fighting for a hole with a half dozen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.79,0:25:44.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那里面住了一群疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}psychopaths living in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.42,0:25:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就让他们住那儿算了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.13,0:25:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也看到了 他们想杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen what they've done… attacked us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.29,0:25:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们杀了我儿子 我们要杀回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}They killed my boy. We're going back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.90,0:25:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是当兵的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.30,0:25:52.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我们杀行尸 那没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want us to kill biters, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.41,0:25:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这就太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.96,0:25:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go home, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.38,0:25:55.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你回去就安全了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're gonna be safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.13,0:25:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要回伍德伯里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going back to Woodbury.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.61,0:25:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来这根本不是解决恩怨的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not here to settle a grudge.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.43,0:28:05.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.37,0:28:08.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.75,0:28:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.74,0:28:20.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.40,0:28:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.97,0:28:25.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.37,0:28:38.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.19,0:28:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.73,0:29:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 好 拿到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.05,0:29:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,米琼恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Michonne.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.47,0:30:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫谢尔告诉我你打死那男孩的事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel told me about the boy you shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.31,0:30:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他拿着枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He had a gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.21,0:30:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是不是正在缴枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he handing it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.35,0:30:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他之前刚袭击了我们 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He had just attacked us. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.09,0:30:18.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 确实\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he had.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.89,0:30:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是不是正在缴枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was he handing it over?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.00,0:30:30.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个险我不能冒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't take the chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.17,0:30:32.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没打死咬死了戴尔的那只行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't kill the walker that killed Dale.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.04,0:30:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看都发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.84,0:30:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,儿子 这不是一回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son, that is not the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.99,0:30:35.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没杀安德鲁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't kill Andrew.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.64,0:30:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果他回来害死了妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he came back and killed Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.51,0:30:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和总督在一个屋子里的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were in a room with the Governor.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.52,0:30:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you let him go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.92,0:30:48.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果他杀了莫尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then he killed Merle.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.52,0:30:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我做了我必须做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did what I had to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.93,0:30:56.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.73,0:30:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他再害死我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he doesn't kill any more of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.35,0:31:21.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克 我们留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, we're staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.51,0:31:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道总督在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know where the Governor is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.43,0:31:25.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他回来 我们来抵御他\N{\fnArial\fs30}If he comes back, we'll hold him off.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.36,0:31:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,就我们三个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just the three of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.30,0:31:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.00,0:31:33.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你们留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate you staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.04,0:31:34.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.24,0:33:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,快开 快开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.73,0:33:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 别慌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.16,0:33:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 快开啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Okay-
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.44,0:33:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.05,0:34:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.59,0:34:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是我 别开枪 - 趴下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's me! Don't… - Get down!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.51,0:34:33.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.18,0:34:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.07,0:34:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没事 - 总督人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm fine! - Where's the Governor?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.98,0:34:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他见人就开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fired on everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.28,0:34:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,把大家都杀光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.72,0:34:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么跟他们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.67,0:34:53.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.63,0:34:58.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming out!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.43,0:35:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.25,0:35:25.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们来这儿干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.42,0:35:29.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本来是要来个了断的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were coming to finish this.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.16,0:35:32.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我们看到了总督干的好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}until we saw what the Governor did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.93,0:35:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把他们都杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He… he killed them?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.43,0:35:40.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.70,0:35:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,凯伦说安德莉亚翻过了墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karen told us Andrea hopped the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.04,0:35:45.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,朝监狱去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}going for the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.54,0:35:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,可她没平安到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}She never made it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.51,0:35:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可能还在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She might be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.44,0:35:53.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他关押格兰和玛姬的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is where he had Glenn and Maggie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.38,0:35:54.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,总督把人关在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Governor held people here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.88,0:35:56.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不只是关押他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did more than hold them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.80,0:36:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,能开门吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you open it?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.98,0:36:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一 二\N{\fnArial\fs30}One, two…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.91,0:36:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,安德莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Andrea!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.32,0:36:40.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本想阻止他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.39,0:36:42.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发高烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're burning up.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.34,0:36:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱迪思 卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judith, Carl,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.11,0:36:58.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the rest of them…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.01,0:37:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.71,0:37:03.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也属于我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rest of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.92,0:37:08.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家还活着吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are they alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.19,0:37:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 都活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, they're alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.60,0:37:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸好你找到了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good you found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.28,0:37:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今没人能独自生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one can make it alone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.42,0:37:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从来都不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}They never could.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.26,0:37:46.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是不想让任何人死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just didn't want anyone to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.76,0:37:54.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我能自我了断 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can do it myself. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.13,0:37:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.30,0:38:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,趁我还有意识\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I still can.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.91,0:38:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.15,0:38:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道保险栓怎么开\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how the safety works.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:37.91,0:38:40.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就留在你身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.16,0:39:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.87,0:39:11.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.21,0:39:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的确尽力了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:11.97,0:41:13.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.88,0:41:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们要加入我们的队伍\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna join us.
